  "source": "Retrieved 12 November 2026 from the BAG 2.0 Extract (stand 8 October 2026) at bag.ldproxy.net, the existing panden of gemeente 0307 with oorspronkelijkBouwjaar below 1800: sources/dsfl/bag-amersfoort-voor-1800-panden.geojson, and the homes in them (stored query verblijfsobjecten-in-panden): sources/dsfl/bag-amersfoort-voor-1800-woningen.json, both recorded in sources/sources.lock.json with their query URLs.",
  "note": "Deck wording: Which houses were built before 1800 in the municipality of Vlaardingen? Show them on the map. Amersfoort replaces Vlaardingen, so all five samples use one municipality. A house is a pand with at least one verblijfsobject with gebruiksdoel woonfunctie and status Verblijfsobject in gebruik or Verbouwing verblijfsobject; that gives 195 panden with 310 homes. must holds those panden. The reference holds the 273 existing panden from before 1800 (status in gebruik, in gebruik (niet ingemeten), verbouwing, sloopvergunning verleend or buiten gebruik), so a map of every old pand, such as a church or a barn, shows more than required and invents nothing. Demolished panden, panden entered by mistake and panden never built are not in the reference. The year is the oorspronkelijkBouwjaar of the pand, and old panden often carry an estimated round year, such as 1750; those count. Whether a monument register should be the source for 'built before 1800' is open for the working group."
